sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Requesting node
    participant Seed as Bootstrap seed
    Client->>Seed: TCP connection (TLS if configured)
    Client->>Seed: BootstrapHello
    Seed->>Seed: Check protocol, formats, identity and cluster
    Seed->>Seed: Validate advertisement and result limit
    alt Rejected
        Seed-->>Client: Error when possible, then close
    else Accepted
        Seed->>Seed: Lease valid advertisement if supplied
        Seed-->>Client: BootstrapAck with candidate endpoints and TTL
        Client->>Client: Validate seed identity and full response
        Note over Client,Seed: Connection closes without peer admission
        Client->>Client: Feed suggestions into normal reconnection
    end
